@description ReaCord: Ultra-lightweight Discord Rich Presence for REAPER
@author Bartek Staniak
@version 1.0.4-beta5
@changelog
  + Fix macOS and Linux extension loading by linking SWELL modstub (resolves undefined Win32 menu symbols)
  + Query host SWELL API via SWELL_PROVIDED_BY_APP for Extensions menu hook
  + Add safety null checks for SWELL menu callbacks in headless/minimal environments
  + Fix Default ID button clipping and balance action buttons in modern ReaImGui UI
@provides
  [win64] reaper_reacord64.dll
  [darwin64] reaper_reacord.dylib
  [darwin-arm64] reaper_reacord.dylib
  [linux64] reaper_reacord-x86_64.so
  [main=main,gui] scripts/ReaCord_Settings_ImGui.lua
@about
  # ReaCord
  Ultra-lightweight native Discord Rich Presence integration for Cockos REAPER.

  ## Highlights
  - Runs natively inside REAPER as an extension with zero external helper programs.
  - Asynchronous background worker thread ensures zero CPU load and zero audio buffer interference.
  - Granular privacy options: opt-in to show/hide project name, session time, playback state, and track counts.
  - Instant Incognito toggle for stealth sessions.
  - Native settings dialog + modern ReaImGui interface with live Discord card preview.
